{
  "title": "Drums Practice",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Read the chart, play the",
        "pad, watch your timing.",
        "",
        "The bar at the bottom is",
        "your error: zero in the",
        "middle, early left, late",
        "right. Narrow is good."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Playing",
      "lines": [
        "PLAY   listen, unscored",
        "REC    practise, scored",
        "Same button pauses; the",
        "other one switches.",
        "MENU   the drill list",
        "BACK   up, then out",
        "SHIFT+click  settings"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The list",
      "lines": [
        "Folders: Basics,",
        "Grooves, Rudiments,",
        "Training and Quiz.",
        "Progress comes last.",
        "",
        "Click opens, Back goes",
        "up. A groove opens its",
        "levels, one limb more",
        "each rung."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs",
      "lines": [
        "1  tempo, 40-240",
        "2  read ahead",
        "3  reps",
        "4  kit layout",
        "",
        "Stopped, knob 1 scrubs;",
        "the pads show the drums",
        "where you landed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The pads",
      "lines": [
        "Left half is your left",
        "hand, right half your",
        "right. Each voice owns a",
        "block; any pad in it",
        "counts.",
        "",
        "kit       the whole kit",
        "sticking  one surface"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Colours",
      "lines": [
        "green   you got it",
        "amber   right drum, but",
        "        WRONG HAND or",
        "        wrong dynamic",
        "red     you missed it",
        "yellow  your finger",
        "violet  now / playing",
        "purple  what is coming",
        "pulse   Study waits here"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Study",
      "lines": [
        "Settings > Study stops",
        "the scroll ON a note you",
        "missed. The lane names",
        "it; Guide pads pulse it.",
        "",
        "One press carries on."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Scoring",
      "lines": [
        "Four things, counted",
        "apart, because each is",
        "fixed differently:",
        "",
        "timing   mean and spread",
        "drum     hit or miss",
        "hand     sticking error",
        "dynamic  accent / ghost"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Ladder",
      "lines": [
        "Play N bars clean and",
        "the tempo goes up. Fail",
        "and it stops.",
        "",
        "Your score is the top",
        "clean tempo, kept per",
        "drill and plotted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Latency",
      "lines": [
        "If every hit reads late",
        "by the same amount, that",
        "is your rig, not you.",
        "",
        "Settings > Latency takes",
        "it off every reading."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sound",
      "lines": [
        "The module has its own",
        "kit and click. Nothing",
        "to set up.",
        "",
        "MIDI out can send to a",
        "track or USB instead."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
